+### Organization transfers
+
+- Only an org admin of the organization in the path may transfer a user out of it. A non-admin in that organization gets 403; a caller from another organization (or an unknown path organization) gets 404.
+- The target user must belong to the path organization, otherwise 404.
+- `toOrgId` is required, must differ from the current organization, and must be an existing organization (one that has at least one user or project). Otherwise 400.
+- On transfer, the user's project memberships are removed and their org-admin flag is cleared. Task assignments are kept as they are.
+
